# k5 (PR 12): the tile loop's ceildiv trips ⌈K/8⌉, the un-unrolled dot
# loop's constant 8, the 2048 B of `As` and `Bs` each CTA declares, and
# each access's address, its loop's iteration as iv, the A and B loads'
# sectors per request unknown until N and K are bound. The tile loop's
# guard `K == 0` skips it where its latch fails at k = 0, `0 < K`, so
# the loop is counted per execution of the guard and the per-thread
# global bytes are exact, 32·⌈K/8⌉ + 128 B loaded and 128 B stored. The
# text report pins the block table, the loop ranking, the tile loop's
# instruction tally per iteration and AI(global) = 32 at the
# steady-state tile altitude, line aggregation recovering the
# fully-unrolled register-tile loops (8 copies of line 55, 64 of line
# 60), and full trip coverage.
RUN: %ptxroof analyze %fixtures/k5/k5.sm_80.ptx | FileCheck "%s"
RUN: %ptxroof analyze --annotate %fixtures/k5/k5.sm_80.ptx | FileCheck --check-prefix=ANN "%s"
CHECK: kernel void hgemm_2d_blocktiling<64, 64, 8, 8, 8>(
CHECK: blocks (program order; loops are named by their header block):
CHECK: block      lines                       instrs  successors            loop
CHECK: /----  <block 0>  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:10-39      10  $L__BB0_5, <block 1>
CHECK: |/-->  $L__BB0_2  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:17-48     155  $L__BB0_3             5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:39 (header)
CHECK: ||<->  $L__BB0_3  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:42-60     111  $L__BB0_3, <block 4>  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:53 (header, latch)
CHECK: |\---  <block 4>  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:39-62       8  $L__BB0_2, <block 5>  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:39 (latch)
CHECK: | /--  <block 5>  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:39          1  $L__BB0_6
CHECK: \--->  $L__BB0_5  (no line info)                  64  $L__BB0_6
CHECK: {{  }}\->  $L__BB0_6  5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:13-72     412  (end)
CHECK: loop with the most instructions (static): 5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:39
CHECK: loop 5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:39 ($L__BB0_2)
CHECK: instructions = 1051
CHECK: cuda-core f32       512
CHECK: {{  }}fma.rn.f32        512
CHECK: integer arithmetic  212
CHECK: {{  }}add.s32            70
CHECK: conversion          128
CHECK: {{  }}cvt.f32.f16       128
CHECK: shared load 2 B     128
CHECK: {{  }}ld.shared.u16     128
CHECK: register move        19
CHECK: AI(global) = 32 flop/B
CHECK: loop 5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:53 ($L__BB0_3)
CHECK: unrolled source lines: 5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:55 x8, 5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:57 x8, 5_2d_blocktiling.cuh:60 x64
CHECK: coverage: loop_trips_resolved 100.0% (2/2)
ANN: {{^}}.visible .entry _Z20hgemm_2d_blocktilingILi64ELi64ELi8ELi8ELi8EEviiifPK6__halfS2_fPS0_( // shared memory 2,048 B/CTA | per thread: flops f32 (1024·⌈param_2/8⌉ + 192); global load (32·⌈param_2/8⌉ + 128) B, store 128 B; shared load 256·⌈param_2/8⌉ B, store 32·⌈param_2/8⌉ B; param load 40 B{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_2: // loop: trips ⌈param_2/8⌉ | under line 64 | exec ⌈param_2/8⌉/thread{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	ld.global.u16 	%rs1, [%rd15]; // global load [(128·param_2)·%ctaid.y + 16·iv[$L__BB0_2] + (2·param_2)·⌊%tid.x/8⌋ + 2·(%tid.x mod 8) + param_4] sectors/req ? (the coefficient of ⌊%tid.x/8⌋ is 2·param_2; bind it){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	st.shared.u16 	[%r20], %rs1; // shared store [2·%tid.x + As] wavefronts/req ? (block shape unknown: no .reqntid; pass --launch){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	ld.global.u16 	%rs9, [%rd31]; // global load [128·%ctaid.x + (16·param_1)·iv[$L__BB0_2] + (2·param_1)·⌊%tid.x/64⌋ + 2·(%tid.x mod 64) + param_5] sectors/req ? (the coefficient of ⌊%tid.x/64⌋ is 2·param_1; bind it){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}$L__BB0_3: // loop: trips 8 | under line 64 | exec 8·⌈param_2/8⌉/thread{{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	ld.shared.u16 	%rs17, [%r110]; // shared load [2·iv[$L__BB0_3] + 128·⌊%tid.x/8⌋ + As] wavefronts/req ? (block shape unknown: no .reqntid; pass --launch){{$}}
ANN: {{^}}	ld.shared.u16 	%rs25, [%r116]; // shared load [128·iv[$L__BB0_3] + 16·(%tid.x mod 8) + Bs] wavefronts/req ? (block shape unknown: no .reqntid; pass --launch){{$}}
